OL,3,GNEWSAPolice search river for
OL,4,A22-year-old missing man
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice and rescue teams are searching a
OL,7,Friver for a man who went missing after
OL,8,Fspending the night with friends.
OL,10,FLiam Potts, 22, was last seen heading
OL,11,Ftowards Wylam, in Northumberland, from
OL,12,FWylam Bridge at about 00:20 BST on
OL,13,FSaturday, Northumbria Police said.
OL,15,FThe force believes he has entered the
OL,16,Fwater.
OL,18,FMountain rescue teams are helping
OL,19,Fpolice with their search of the River
OL,20,FTyne and the surrounding Wylam area.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
